    <question_explanation no="8" id="PRB-41E68659ABA7BCF1-Q8">
      <question_stem>협회적하약관(Institute Cargo Clauses, 2009) 제13조에 대한 내용이다. ㉠ ～ ㉢에 해당하는 용어가 바르게 연결된 것은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>법령 조문</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>1</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>Constructive Total Loss abandoned actual total loss</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 무역학 · ICC 제13조 추정전손
정답은 ①이다. 협회적하약관 제13조는 추정전손(Constructive Total Loss)을 규정한다. 보험목적물의 현실전손(actual total loss)이 불가피해 보이거나, 회복·수선·운송 비용이 도착 시 가액을 초과하여 목적물을 합리적으로 위부(abandoned)한 경우가 아니면 추정전손으로 보상받을 수 없다.</overall_commentary>
      <passage_evidence>No claim for ( ㉠ ) shall be recoverable hereunder unless the subject-matter insured is reasonably ( ㉡ ) either on account of its ( ㉢ ) appearing to be unavoidable or because the cost of recovering, reconditioning and for...</passage_evidence>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>Constructive Total Loss abandoned actual total loss</choice_text>
          <commentary>Constructive Total Loss, abandoned, actual total loss이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Constructive Total Loss subrogated actual total loss</choice_text>
          <commentary>㉡이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>actual total loss abandoned Constructive Total Loss</choice_text>
          <commentary>㉠, ㉢이 뒤바뀌었다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>actual total loss subrogated Constructive Total Loss</choice_text>
          <commentary>㉠~㉢이 모두 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="2">유사·중복 출제 2회 (2016년 · 7급 공개경쟁채용시험)</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="9" id="PRB-41E68659ABA7BCF1-Q9">
      <question_stem>포터(M. E. Porter)가 제시한 기업 가치사슬(value chain) 모형의 세계적 배치활동에서 본원적 활동(primary activity)만을 모두 고르면?</question_stem>
