        <keyword>수입대체보조금은 금지보조금(prohibited subsidy)</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>1</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>수출실적에 따라 지급되는 보조금은 상계가능보조금(actionable subsidy)에 속한다.</correct_choice_text>
